(# Healthy API - Postman Guide) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This guide documents all routes in `healthy_api/controllers/api.py` and how to call them from Postma) Tj
T*
(n.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Mobile-Managed Integration \(Scope\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This integration is fully managed by the mobile application.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- The mobile app drives the full lifecycle: signup request, admin approval, login, and daily operati) Tj
T*
(ons.) Tj
T*
(- All business actions should be done through these API endpoints \(not Odoo manual back-office opera) Tj
T*
(tions\).) Tj
T*
(- Every protected endpoint requires the daily token returned by login.) Tj
T*
(- Users must login from mobile first, then call other endpoints using `Authorization: Bearer <daily_) Tj
T*
(token>`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 1\) Postman Setup) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Create these Postman variables:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `base_url` = your Odoo host \(example: `http://localhost:8069`\)) Tj
T*
(- `token` = API token returned from login) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For authenticated calls, add header:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `Authorization: {{token}}`) Tj
T*
(- `Content-Type: application/json`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Public routes \(no token\):) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `POST {{base_url}}/auth/signup`) Tj
T*
(- `POST {{base_url}}/auth/login` \(or `/api/login`\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 2\) Core Business Endpoints) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Auth) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `POST /auth/signup`) Tj
T*
(- `POST /auth/login` \(alias: `POST /api/login`\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Signup body:) Tj
T*
(```json) Tj
T*
({) Tj
T*
(  "name": "John Doe",) Tj
T*
(  "email": "john@example.com",) Tj
T*
(  "mobile": "+201234567890",) Tj
T*
(  "password": "StrongPassword123") Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Login body:) Tj
T*
(```json) Tj
T*
({) Tj
T*
(  "email_or_mobile": "john@example.com",) Tj
T*
(  "password": "StrongPassword123") Tj
T*
(}) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
