T*
(Login response returns the daily token in `data.token`.  ) Tj
T*
(Use that token in `Authorization: <daily_token>` for all protected endpoints.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Users & Roles \(Admin\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `GET /users`) Tj
T*
(- `GET /users/{id}`) Tj
T*
(- `POST /users`) Tj
T*
(- `PUT /users/{id}`) Tj
T*
(- `DELETE /users/{id}`) Tj
T*
(- `PUT /users/{id}/approve`) Tj
T*
(- `PUT /users/{id}/role`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Create/Update body example:) Tj
T*
(```json) Tj
T*
({) Tj
T*
(  "name": "Area Manager 1",) Tj
T*
(  "email": "am1@example.com",) Tj
T*
(  "password": "StrongPassword123",) Tj
T*
(  "mobile": "+201111111111",) Tj
T*
(  "area_name": "Nasr City",) Tj
T*
(  "roles": ["area_manager"],) Tj
T*
(  "active": true) Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Assign role body:) Tj
T*
(```json) Tj
T*
({) Tj
T*
(  "roles": ["delivery"]) Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Merchants) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `GET /merchants` \(alias: `/api/merchants`\)) Tj
T*
(- `POST /merchants`) Tj
T*
(- `GET /merchants/{id}`) Tj
T*
(- `PUT /merchants/{id}`) Tj
T*
(- `DELETE /merchants/{id}` \(Admin\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Create/Update body example:) Tj
T*
(```json) Tj
T*
({) Tj
T*
(  "merchant_code": "M-1001",) Tj
T*
(  "name": "Merchant A",) Tj
T*
(  "mobile": "+201000000000",) Tj
T*
(  "address": "Cairo",) Tj
T*
(  "commercial_registration": "CR12345",) Tj
T*
(  "tax_card": "TAX56789") Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Orders) Tj
T*
() Tj
