T*
(- `POST /orders`) Tj
T*
(- `PUT /orders/{id}`) Tj
T*
(- `DELETE /orders/{id}` \(Admin\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Create body:) Tj
T*
(```json) Tj
T*
({) Tj
T*
