(## 3\) Admin Approval Endpoints) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(These are still API-based and can be consumed by an admin mobile panel \(or admin client\):) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `GET /api/signup_requests/{id?}`) Tj
T*
(- `POST /api/signup_requests/{id}/approve`) Tj
T*
(- `POST /api/signup_requests/{id}/reject`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 4\) Common Postman Notes) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Use `Body -> raw -> JSON` for POST/PUT.) Tj
T*
(- For routes with `{id}`, replace with integer ID \(example: `/orders/55`\).) Tj
T*
(- If you get `401 Unauthorized`, refresh token with login and update `{{token}}`.) Tj
T*
(- If you get `403 Forbidden`, check user role and endpoint access matrix.) Tj
ET
endstream
